    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry Fitzgerald Reilly are delighted to introduce ' The Bungalow' to the market, a B rated, beautifully presented, impressive four / five bedroom detached bungalow with stable block, workshop etc and set on approximately 3.74 acres of lands. \nDesigned with the equestrian enthusiast in mind, the property benefits from excellent facilities suitable for private use, training or boutique equestrian operations.\nApproached through impressive, electronic entrance gates along a gravel driveway you will immediately begin to appreciate that this is undoubtedly a special home blessed with style, modern features and privacy in a truly wonderful location. \nLocated in a private, rustic setting there are a number of towns and villages including Prosperous, Clane, Sallins and Naas nearby providing all the amenities required for modern living, Dublin city and its surrounding areas are easily accessible via a frequent bus service, rail links from nearby Sallins and Maynooth combined with proximity to the M4 and M7 Motorways.\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire an exceptional, spacious family home in a super setting. \nProsperous 1.5km, Clane 5 km, Sallins 8 km, Naas 10 km and Maynooth 17 km approximately."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.15 x 7.26\nLarge bright reception hall with tilled floor, alarm keypad, recessed lighting, composite front door.\n\nLiving Room - 3.8 x 4.54\nBeautiful living room with feature fire surround with open fireplace and stove insert, very bright dual aspect living room.\n\nKitchen - 6.6 x 3.8\nLarge kitchen dining room with solid fuel stove, tilled flooring, recessed lighting, feature centre light, gate entry system, access to hall and utilty room, double doors to side, extensive fitted kitchen wall and base units with quartz countertop, Smeg Range cooker with gas hob, Smeg Extractor Hood and fridge/freezer.\n\nUtility Room - 2.4 x 3.6\nExtensive storage units, plumbed for appliances, tiled flooring, back door access.\n\nStudy / Bedroom 5 - 3.4 x 3.6\nTo back.\n\nBathroom - 2.8 x 3.6\nWith tiled floor and walls, attractive three piece bathroom suite, shaving light and mirror, corner shower unit, attic hatch.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.2 x 4.2\nMain bedroom, dual aspect, t.v. and phone point, ensuite bathroom off.\n\nEn-Suite - 3 x 1\nTiled floor and walls, w.c., w.h.b., shower unit, shaving light and mirror.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.6 x 4.4\nWith wardrobes, t.v. and phone point, ensuite bathroom off.\n\nEn-Suite - 1 x 3.6\nTiled floor and walls, w.c., w.h.b., shower unit, shaving light and mirror.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.1 x3.2\nTo front with fitted wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.1 x 3.2\nTo front with fitted wardrobe.\n\n. - \n\n\nSpecial Features & Services - \nContents Included: blinds, light fittings ( except liv room and kit), curtains, dishwasher, fridge / freezer, Smeg Range with gas hob and electric oven, Smeg Extractor Hood.\n\nSpecial Features & Services - \nThree large fenced paddocks.Stable Block 15 x 11.3 with cctv, water, four stables , feed house, haybarn.work shop 63'x 19'\n\nSpecial Features & Services - \nPrimary & secondary schools at ProsperousFrequent bus service to the city, Arrow rail link from Sallins and MaynoothEasy access to both the M4 & M7 motorway.Wide range of sporting and recreational facilities available in close proximity.House approx 118 meters in length off main road up avenue.Services: Mains water and septic tankFolio: KE45420F & KE44324F\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Site Size: Circa 3.74 Acres </li><li>Constructed c. 2010</li><li>Approximately 1,900 sqft.</li><li>Alarmed</li><li>Double glazed windows, Oil fired central heating</li><li>Attic suitable for conversion, Electric gated entrance</li><li>High-quality and low maintenance UPVC fascia, soffits and gutters</li><li>Generous bedroom accommodation </li><li>High specification finishes throughout</ul>"
      },
